  "description": "The Energie Carbon is our high performance full carbon cyclocross race bike\n\nDesigned specifically to meet the demands of all-out CX assaults and help you achieve your best come race day. Our full carbon High-Modulus T700 frame features increased stiffness and mud clearance making this a competitive CX race bike.\n\nThe Energie CR comes equipped with a race ready single ring set up built around the SRAM Rival 1 HRD groupset which combines a mid-range race ratio cassette with a single ring X-SYNC 40t chainring and Rival hydraulic disc brakes. This race machine is completed with a tubeless compatible Alex CXD22 / Novatec CX specific wheelset and Vitus finishing kit to complete the package.\n\nThe Energie CR frameset features a High-Modulus T700 HM-UD Carbon construction for superior strength to weight. Full internal cable routing has been specifically designed to prevent ingress of mud and water and to increase comfort when shouldering the bike during racing",
